# rollup-plugin-visualizer output (ANALYZE=1 pnpm build)
stats.html

# Vitest browser-mode artefacts. Both are written by a *failing* run -- the
# attachment store and one screenshot per failed test -- so they are leftovers of
# a red suite, never an input to one. They sit next to the tests rather than in a
# build directory, which is why `git add tests/` would otherwise pick them up.
# Note: toMatchScreenshot() baselines would land in __screenshots__ as well and
# would need an exception here before visual regression tests can be added.
.vitest-attachments
**/__screenshots__
